# =============================================================================
#  v4.5.6-FINAL-PREQUAL-ACCOUNTING-OBS  (ADDITIVE / SURGICAL / FAIL-CLOSED)
# =============================================================================
#
#  Scope (observability & accounting ONLY — no trading-logic relaxation):
#    * Canonical-prequalification WINDOWED telemetry (rolling counts kept
#      separate from cumulative counters; per-reject context records).
#    * Correct STAGE ACCOUNTING: generated -> hard_valid -> ranked -> winners
#      -> prequalified -> canonical -> queued -> sent; any transition loss that
#      cannot be attributed raises [PIPELINE-ACCOUNTING-VIOLATION] and bumps
#      v455_mse_unattributed_loss / v455_prequal_unattributed_loss /
#      v455_execution_unattributed_loss. Telemetry-only: never blocks trading.
#    * MSE vs GLOBAL semantic separation: mse_winners is NEVER reported as
#      global selected / queued / sent.
#    * Starvation classifier upgrade: deterministic modes
#      NONE/NO_OPP/SCAN_STALE/PREQUAL/HTF/LIQUIDITY/STRUCTURE/SCORE/
#      EXECUTION/SYSTEM/ACCOUNTING with dominant_prequal_reason + share.
#      Priority: SYSTEM > ACCOUNTING/PREQUAL_EXCEPTION > PREQUAL >
#      HTF/LIQUIDITY/STRUCTURE > SCORE > EXECUTION > NO_OPP.
#    * Starvation alert ESCALATION (level 1..3) + one-shot [STARV-DIAG]
#      diagnostic dump with cooldown. No auto-relax is added or widened.
#    * Heartbeat extensions: [HB-FUNNEL]/[HB-BOTTLENECK]/[HB-MSE]/
#      [HB-COVERAGE] with PQTOP (window + cumulative), PQEX/PQPASS/PQREJ,
#      TOPSYM, SNAPMISS, STALE, family coverage. Human line preserved.
#    * Optional structured JSON heartbeat ([HB_JSON]) — flag-gated, log-only,
#      never sent to Telegram by default, failure is telemetry-only.
#    * ISO-8601 UTC timestamps in structured telemetry; internal clock math
#      untouched (MONO_NOW for durations, WALL_NOW for wall timestamps).
#    * Candidate-freshness audit: windowed age p50/p95, stale/unverifiable
#      counts with context (generated_at_ms, now_wall, age_sec). DEBUG/window
#      aggregated only. WALL_NOW clock domain unchanged.
#    * Snapshot-missing audit: SNAPMISS windowed counter + top reasons;
#      a symbol absent from the snapshot is recorded, never silently dropped.
#    * HTF NEUTRAL policy: floor stays configurable with safety-preserving
#      default STRICT (45, unchanged). Optional BOUNDED_RELAXED helper exists
#      but is INERT unless explicitly enabled AND per-family allow-listed;
#      it can never override crash / hard-bearish / family-disallowed /
#      liquidity / structure / safety gates. HTF distribution telemetry added.
#    * Top-rejected-symbols windowed telemetry (bounded, top-3 in heartbeat).
#    * MSE per-family windowed coverage (gen/valid/ranked/selected/pre/rej).
#    * Persistence of WORTHWHILE telemetry only (namespaced persisted_*),
#      via SQLite KV; never used for starvation decisions after restart.
#    * Runtime assertions: counter monotonicity, negative deltas, impossible
#      stage ordering -> log + diagnostic counter, never stop trading.
#    * Self-tests T17..T32 (offline, fail-closed) + invariant re-checks.
#
#  Non-goals (explicitly NOT done in this version): no new strategies, no HTF
#  global relaxation, no manual score-threshold cut, no liquidity/structure/
#  BOS/freshness weakening, no snapshot-missing=allow, no new fetches for
#  telemetry, no exception->pass conversions, no fall-open.
