# v4.5.17 — COMPREHENSIVE FINAL HARDENING / UNKNOWN-OUTCOME + CYCLE + TEST REGISTRY
# =============================================================================
# This is the final consolidation layer for the remaining hardening items:
#   1) Canonical single SCRIPT_VERSION / __version__ assignment.
#   2) One boot self-test registry; comprehensive suite executes ONCE.
#   3) Unknown execution outcome reconciliation for ENTRY / SL / TP.
#      No blind retries are permitted when the venue may have accepted an order.
#   4) Cycle ID is stamped at GEN and propagated through candidate -> selection.
#   5) Selection attribution remains separated: POOL_RANK vs SELECTION.
#   6) Cohort telemetry is cycle-scoped and cannot silently mix cycles.
#   7) Critical tests are PASS/FAIL only; SKIPPED is failure.
#   8) All hard trading/security invariants remain unchanged.
# =============================================================================

