# v4.5.87 FINAL — PULLBACK PRECISION / JIT VALIDATION / FORBIDDEN COIN GUARD
# =============================================================================
# One-pass closure of the remaining signal-quality root causes identified in
# the production review of v4.5.86.
#
# A) PULLBACK precision is increased WITHOUT weakening any safety gate:
#      * require two independent closed-bar recovery confirmations by default;
#      * require non-negative RS and a bounded volume floor for live PULLBACK;
#      * reject strong bearish displacement / stale recovery structure;
#      * require a finite structural/retest quality envelope;
#      * calculate a deterministic Setup Quality score for operator telemetry.
#
# B) The Telegram "Quality" grade is de-inflated. It is an honest setup score,
#    NOT a probability-of-profit claim and no longer lets HTF/volume dominate a
#    weak local setup into an A+ headline.
#
# C) JIT PULLBACK entry validation is added immediately before OrderExecutor:
#      * current ask must remain inside a bounded envelope around the planned
#        entry; materially lower drift is treated as a possible falling knife,
#        materially higher drift as a chase.
#      * the validation is advisory only for non-PULLBACK families and hard for
#        live PULLBACK/MTF_PULLBACK because this is strategy thesis validation,
#        not an exchange safety bypass.
#
# D) Forbidden-coin protection is fail-closed at TWO layers:
#      * SignalBuilder layer: no candidate analysis / no BUY alert / no queue.
#      * OrderExecutor layer: absolute final defense; no BUY reaches exchange.
#      * Telegram sends an explicit "NOT EXECUTED — FORBIDDEN COIN" message.
#
# E) The blacklist is deliberately configurable because there is no universal
#    canonical religious list. The shipped default is a conservative exact and
#    keyword blacklist for clearly gambling/casino/betting-themed assets. The
#    operator can expand the exact list through CONFIG or the environment.
#
# INVARIANTS PRESERVED:
# LONG_ONLY / MEXC SPOT / fail-closed / Balance / TruthSeal / Exposure /
# Liquidity / PreSend / SL / execution ambiguity / KillSwitch / watchdog /
# circuit breaker / sizing / exit authority.
# No SELL path, risk math or execution authority is bypassed.
# =============================================================================

