# =============================================================================
# Raw MSE candidates may be rejected by V588 before CompositeRankingEngine,
# producing GEN/HARD_VALID activity with RANK=0. This patch adds a narrow,
# evidence-backed recall lane for close-quality misses only. Recovered
# candidates still traverse the normal ranking, global arbitration, canonical
# SignalBuilder, PreSendGate and execution authority. No order method exists in
# this layer. Separately, a bounded Telegram near-miss is knowledge-only.
