# v4.5.99-V644 FINAL — CURRENT-CYCLE CANONICAL PREEXEC + SELFTEST CLOSURE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The final live handoff now rechecks the exact V587 PULLBACK precision contract
# on the current-cycle market snapshot immediately before SignalBuilder. Only an
# explicit canonical rejection is skipped; errors/unavailable data stay with the
# canonical builder. Legacy V640 identity checks are run through a compatibility
# adapter so they cannot emit a false version failure before V644 normalization.
# V517/V560 mock-exchange recoveries are marked as self-test telemetry only.
# All hard safety/execution authorities remain unchanged.
