# V658 does NOT lower the original hard floors. It adds a bounded QUALITY
# RECONCILIATION layer that can replace a single stale/point-in-time measurement
# with an independently verified, closed-bar measurement only when the whole
# setup is exceptionally strong. The original V587 contract then runs AGAIN on
# the reconciled candidate. Any uncertainty remains fail-closed.
# =============================================================================

