# V659 FINAL — CANONICAL POLICY AUTHORITY DECOUPLING
# =============================================================================
# Do not recursively execute historical policy wrappers at runtime: those
# wrappers intentionally preserve their old identities and can make a valid
# successor build fail merely because a predecessor literal is stale. Safety
# policy is preserved by calling the original V647 base validator directly,
# then checking every successor invariant explicitly under the V659 tuple.
# This is stricter and simpler than identity gymnastics through V641-V658.

