# V661 FINAL — TRUE CANONICAL PB/MTF AUTHORITY / STALE-PREQUAL CLOSURE /
# CURRENT-CYCLE FORENSICS
# =============================================================================
# Built directly on V660. This is the consolidation pass for the remaining
# live bottlenecks observed in production logs:
#   1) V655/V660 structural arbiter could be bypassed by a family-name mismatch
#      (PULLBACK vs PULLBACK_CANONICAL), causing genuine recovery candidates to
#      fall back into repeated fake-break/microstruct rejects.
#   2) The canonical prequalification chain could evaluate quality/precision
#      before V660 reconciliation had been materialized onto the candidate.
#   3) Different stages could read different snapshots of the same closed bar,
#      producing inconsistent retest/volume/RS/structure decisions in one cycle.
#   4) Historical MSE rank/fee and execution test counters were polluting the
#      live heartbeat attribution.
#
# V661 does NOT lower any original hard trading floor. It only makes the same
# closed-bar evidence authoritative across PB/MTF structural + quality checks,
# adds bounded same-candidate memoization, and separates self-test telemetry from
# live telemetry. All downstream canonical gates remain mandatory.
