# execution gate. V668 only changes ranking/refill preference and adds a bounded
# max-hold exit that reuses the existing centralized exit authority and the same
# reconciled MARKET SELL path as TP exits. Target-only / ambiguous / unverified
# protection states remain fail-closed and are never force-closed here.
# =============================================================================
