#     _V517_ACTIVE_CYCLE_ID.
#   * Rejection events created after the Brain therefore fell back to an older
#     cycle id and were invisible to current-cycle starvation truth.
# V681 fixes telemetry/accounting ownership only. No trade gate is relaxed.
