#   4) MSE family telemetry is made truthful in heartbeat so strategy coverage
#      can be diagnosed from the live run itself (not legacy OPP counters).
#   5) The terminal validation proves the new closure is active and that no
#      hard economic floor / BELOW-tier prohibition has been weakened.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
