# =============================================================================
# V695 FINAL — DISCOVERY->LIVE HANDOFF / CURRENT-CYCLE TRUTH CLOSURE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Objective: make high-quality verified Discovery opportunities participate in
# the EXISTING live handoff path instead of remaining informational only.
# This does NOT turn the Discovery notifier into an execution authority.
# It only lowers the *pending-handoff admission* threshold from 90 -> 80,
# bounded by the same current preflight + freshness + canonical builder gates.
# The normal live funnel remains authoritative for every order.
#
# Also closed here:
#   - MSE family telemetry bug: runtime stores family counters as flattened
#     STATS keys (e.g. mse_generated_by_strategy.X), so prior dict-based HB
#     extraction was empty. V695 aggregates the actual keys.
#   - Starvation truth drift when SELECTED>0 but Q/S remain zero: telemetry now
#     reports EXECUTION unless an actual system hazard is active.
#   - Discovery handoff observability: every eligible discovery candidate gets
#     an exact handoff state (REGISTERED / NOT_REGISTERED + reason) in logs and
#     bounded heartbeat telemetry.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HARD INVARIANTS UNCHANGED:
#   LONG_ONLY SPOT, no futures/leverage/shorts, hard score/HTF/structure/
#   liquidity/economic/SL/PreSend/Balance/TruthSeal/Exposure/execution gates,
#   one canonical execution authority, fail-closed behavior.
